ria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 12c.94-3.46 4.94-6 8.5-6 3.56 0 6.06 2.54 7 6-.94 3.47-3.44 6-7 6s-7.56-2.53-8.5-6Z\"></path><path d=\"M18 12v.5\"></path><path d=\"M16 17.93a9.77 9.77 0 0 1 0-11.86\"></path><path d=\"M7 10.67C7 8 5.58 5.97 2.73 5.5c-1 1.5-1 5 .23 6.5-1.24 1.5-1.24 5-.23 6.5C5.58 18.03 7 16 7 13.33\"></path><path d=\"M10.46 7.26C10.2 5.88 9.17 4.24 8 3h5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.98 1.67l.23 1.4\"></path><path d=\"m16.01 17.93-.23 1.4A2 2 0 0 1 13.8 21H9.5a5.96 5.96 0 0 0 1.49-3.98\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-700 max-h-0 w-0 max-w-0 translate-y-8 opacity-0\"><h4 class=\"font-unbounded text-xl font-semibold text-background mb-2\">Pisciculture</h4><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-background/80 line-clamp-2\">Élevage de poissons d&#x27;eau douce africains.</p><a class=\"mt-3 inline-block font-unbounded text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-cap-yellow transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/pisciculture\">En savoir plus</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 mt-32 w-full px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-20 lg:mt-48\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-2xl flex-col items-center text-center \"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-unbounded text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cap-dark-green justify-center\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-cap-dark-green/60 to-cap-green/20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Notre Évolution</h3></div><div class=\"relative mb-20 flex w-full items-center justify-center px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-20\"><div class=\"flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center text-center font-unbounded text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-wide sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl md:leading-[1.3] lg:text-4xl text-cap-dark-green\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden py-[0.12em]\"><p class=\"m-0\" style=\"transform:translateY(110%)\">CAP CONGO est structurée en quatre branches complémentaires,</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden py-[0.12em]\"><p class=\"m-0\" style=\"transform:translateY(110%)\">couvrant l&#x27;ensemble de la chaîne de valeur agricole au fil du temps.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden py-[0.12em]\"><p class=\"m-0\" style=\"transform:translateY(110%)\">La première vue se fixe en entier, puis le défilement révèle chaque branche ;</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden py-[0.12em]\"><p class=\"m-0\" style=\"transform:translateY(110%)\">la dernière reste visible en entier avant la suite.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 w-full min-w-0\"><section class=\"relative w-full max-w-full overflow-x-clip bg-background h-auto md:h-[var(--scroll-vh)]\" style=\"--scroll-vh:500vh;--ul-width:400%;--slide-width:25%\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Branche précédente\" class=\"absolute left-3 top-1/2 z-40 -translate-y-1/2 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-cap-dark/10 bg-background/80 text-cap-dark shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md transition hover:bg-background active:scale-95 md:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Branche suivante\" class=\"absolute right-3 top-1/2 z-40 -translate-y-1/2 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-cap-dark/10 bg-background/80 text-cap-dark shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md transition hover:bg-background active:scale-95 md:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"relative flex w-full ove